# Field middleware DI

HotChocolate caches field middleware per field. Do not inject scoped services in the constructor (`ICurrentUserAccessor`, `IRequestContext`, other scoped types).

Resolve them per request: `InvokeAsync` parameters or `context.Services.GetRequiredService<T>()`.

Read correlation IDs from the active request context during invocation.

```csharp
public class ItemMiddleware(FieldDelegate next)
{
    public async Task InvokeAsync(
        IMiddlewareContext context,
        ICurrentUserAccessor currentUserAccessor)
    {
        var userId = currentUserAccessor.CurrentUserId?.ToString();
        await next(context);
    }
}
```
